{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Amsterdam just past noon and went straight to Dr. Besseling, who received me with the warmth Mr. van Ghert had promised. The city is bright, the water everywhere, and the air is sharp.\n\nAfterward, I visited the picture gallery. It is a vast undertaking, but I could not finish the collection today. I spent hours before the Rembrandts. One canvas, fifteen to twenty feet across and twelve high, commands the room with a gravity that stops the breath. It is not mere decoration; it holds a whole world’s suffering and dignity in its strokes. One sees the spirit of the age not in its politics, but in how it renders the human face.\n\nI am tired but content. The journey is good for the mind. I hope the boys are well and that you are keeping your health. I think of you constantly in these quiet evenings.\n\nYour loving,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080109,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":196,"prompt_tokens":938,"total_tokens":1134,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-kZtc3p6z4Zf5DnUMGj2xi6ltAGgDAAR4","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":938,"prompt_ms":1050.392,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.119820895522388,"prompt_per_second":892.9999466865703,"predicted_n":196,"predicted_ms":4698.35,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.094102564102567,"predicted_per_second":41.50393223152809}}